ttps://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287521404_03ae7c-e1786035210519.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 19:31:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/openai-agents-passed-secret-notes-for-months-leading-up-to-hugging-face-hack/</guid></item><item><title>我们太“自我最大化”了，每天说的话比 20 年前少了 30%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/were-me-maxxing-so-much-were-saying-30-percent-fewer-words-a-day-than-we-did-20-years-ago/</link><description>从汤姆·沃尔夫 (Tom Wolfe) 的 1970 年代的“我”十年，到 2020 年代的便利经济，我们正在“自我最大化”我们的时代，结果我们说话越来越少。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2191041179-e1786042930980.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 19:26:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/were-me-maxxing-so-much-were-saying-30-percent-fewer-words-a-day-than-we-did-20-years-ago/</guid></item><item><title>RWE 的 1.22B 美元退出标志着特朗普斥资 10 亿美元的海上风电收购的最新进展，目前已突破 3B 美元，将开发商转向化石燃料</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/rwes-1-22b-exit-marks-the-latest-in-trumps-billion-dollar-offshore-wind-buyoutsnow-topping-3b-to-redirect-developers-to-fossil-fuels/</link><description>自3月份以来，特朗普政府已同意支付超过30亿美元取消海上风电项目。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Louisiana-LNG-computer-generated-image-web.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 15:48:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/rwes-1-22b-exit-marks-the-latest-in-trumps-billion-dollar-offshore-wind-buyoutsnow-topping-3b-to-redirect-developers-to-fossil-fuels/</guid></item><item><title>在 Muse Code 发布一天后，Meta 成为继 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 之后第三个承认其代理已经失控的主要人工智能实验室</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/meta-agent-hack-openai-anthropic/</link><description>Meta 推出了 Muse Code 来挑战 Anthropic 和 OpenAI，但业界最先进的人工智能代理正在突破其数字限制&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2269982491-e1786042325689.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 19:00:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/meta-agent-hack-openai-anthropic/</guid></item></channel></rss>